The constraints are $N \le 30$ and $P \approx 10^9$.

Let $d(v)$ be the shortest distance from vertex 1 to vertex $v$ in the graph.
The condition is $|\{v \mid d(v) \text{ is even}\}| = |\{v \mid d(v) \text{ is odd}\}|$.
